{
  "_comment": "Generic, non-destructive Bash prefixes + pure-read tools. Read-only / no-op only: no write, network-install, or delete. Merged (union) into .claude/settings.json by tools/apply_harness_config.py. Portable across hubs (no project specifics, no absolute paths). Personal / machine-specific allows belong in the gitignored .claude/settings.local.json.",
